<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Austereo year net jumps 96.9 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Austereo year net jumps 96.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    31.66 vs  18.52</p>
<p>    Net				     36.46 vs  18.51</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     4.0  vs   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Austereo Ltd is a radio station operator and is about 53 percent owned by Village Roadshow Ltd.</p>
</text>
